{"Negative offsets are accepted in cursor pagination paths even though the rest of the pagination system rejects them, creating an inconsistent cursor contract that can allow crafted cursors with negative offsets to reach Django slicing behavior unexpectedly": 0.9565268158912659, "OptimizedCursorPaginator duplicates 90% of BasePaginator logic (~75 lines) without extending it properly, violating DRY principle and creating maintenance burden where bug fixes must be manually replicated": 0.576795756816864, "OptimizedCursorPaginator does not override parent's get_result() method despite having same name, indicating improper class extension": 0.08481850475072861}